# .swiftformat
# Extension
#
# Created by zeewanderer on 01.09.2026.

--min-version 0.63.0
--swift-version 6.1
--language-mode 6

# Project layout conventions.
--indent 4
--tab-width 4
--allman true
--else-position next-line
--guard-else same-line
--ifdef no-indent
--ranges no-space
--linebreaks lf
--trim-whitespace always
--header ignore
--max-width none

# Preserve intentional compact declarations and existing line-length choices.
--wrap-arguments preserve
--wrap-parameters preserve
--wrap-conditions preserve
--wrap-collections before-first
--closing-paren balanced
--call-site-paren balanced
--trailing-commas collections-only
--indent-case false

# Formatting-only whitelist. SwiftFormat also offers source-rewriting rules,
# which are intentionally outside the formatter's responsibility here.
#
# The braces rule cannot enforce Allman declarations without also moving
# trailing-closure braces, and the indent rule moves the project's top-level
# where clauses. Leave both to review until SwiftFormat can express the mixed
# house style without rewriting already-correct code.
--rules blankLineAfterImports,blankLinesAroundMark,blankLinesAtEndOfScope
--rules blankLinesAtStartOfScope,blankLinesBetweenScopes
--rules consecutiveBlankLines,consecutiveSpaces,consistentSwitchCaseSpacing
--rules elseOnSameLine,leadingDelimiters,linebreakAtEndOfFile,linebreaks
--rules spaceAroundBraces,spaceAroundBrackets,spaceAroundComments
--rules spaceAroundGenerics,spaceAroundOperators,spaceAroundParens
--rules spaceInsideBraces,spaceInsideBrackets,spaceInsideComments
--rules spaceInsideGenerics,spaceInsideParens,trailingCommas,trailingSpace
--rules wrap,wrapArguments
